{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03389","headline":"称心寺 · 宋之问","name":"称心寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"步陟招提宫，北极山海观。\n千岩递萦绕，万壑殊悠漫。\n乔木转夕阳，文轩划清涣。\n泄云多表里，惊潮每昏旦。\n问予金门客，何事沧洲畔。\n谬以三署资，来刺百城半。\n人隐尚未弭，岁华岂兼玩。\n东山桂枝芳，明发坐盈叹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03389.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03389","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}